  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/libraryMinigame.yarn-libraryMinigame_check-9282": "HARWELL: 看来这些书分得还不太对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/libraryMinigame.yarn-libraryMinigame_check-9283": "HARWELL: 再试一次吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/backerBooks.yarn-backerBook82-9204": "“。劳犒份这得值你。吧下一祝庆饼薄些拿去。心开得玩时谜解你望希过不，间时的你了误耽，歉抱”"
}
